gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkkentzh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkkentzh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkkentzh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkkentzh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkkentzh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkkentzh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clarkkentzh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/504340561","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/issues/25204#issuecomment-504340561","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/25204","id":504340561,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUwNDM0MDU2MQ==","user":{"login":"OlivierFreyssinet-old","id":29233698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjMzNjk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29233698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierFreyssinet-old","html_url":"https://github.com/OlivierFreyssinet-old","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierFreyssinet-old/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierFreyssinet-old/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierFreyssinet-old/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierFreyssinet-old/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierFreyssinet-old/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierFreyssinet-old/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierFreyssinet-old/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierFreyssinet-old/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivierFreyssinet-old/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-06-21T08:28:41Z","updated_at":"2019-06-21T08:45:16Z","body":"It doesn't work for me either on app start. (on Android, RN 0.59.8, I didn't test on iOS)\r\n\r\nUntil there's a fix, the quick workaround I found was to directly call the AppState native module:\r\n\r\n```\r\n...\r\nimport {NativeModules} from 'react-native'\r\nconst AppStateNativeModule = NativeModules.AppState\r\n\r\nclass YourComponent extends React.Component {\r\n  componentDidMount() {\r\n    this.initAppStateListener()\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  componentWillUnmount() {\r\n    AppState.removeEventListener('change', this.handleAppState)\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  initAppStateListener = () => {\r\n    try {\r\n      // HERE call the NativeModule to get the current App state\r\n      AppStateNativeModule.getCurrentAppState(\r\n        res => {\r\n          this.handleAppState(res.app_state)\r\n        },\r\n        () => {} // error callback is needed in the getCurrentAppState function signature\r\n      )\r\n    } catch (e) {}\r\n    AppState.addEventListener('change', this.handleAppState)\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  handleAppState = nextAppState => {\r\n   //...\r\n  }\r\n  //...\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nEDIT: (simpler solution)\r\n\r\n> To see the current state, you can check AppState.currentState, which will be kept up-to-date. However, currentState will be null at launch while AppState retrieves it over the bridge.\r\n\r\nThis is what's written in the docs, I think it's way simpler & safer to use than my solution above haha, I didn't try it though\r\n\r\nEDIT: it works:\r\n\r\n```\r\ninitAppStateListener = () => {\r\n  const {currentState} = AppState\r\n  this.handleAppState(currentState)\r\n  AppState.addEventListener('change', this.handleAppState)\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/504340561/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":n